<figure class="post__image"><img loading="lazy"  src="https://RubenGarcia11.github.io/2damasi/media/posts/4/IMG_1510.jpg" alt="" width="5712" height="4284" sizes="(max-width: 48em) 100vw, 768px" srcset="https://RubenGarcia11.github.io/2damasi/media/posts/4/responsive/IMG_1510-xs.jpg 300w ,https://RubenGarcia11.github.io/2damasi/media/posts/4/responsive/IMG_1510-sm.jpg 480w ,https://RubenGarcia11.github.io/2damasi/media/posts/4/responsive/IMG_1510-md.jpg 768w ,https://RubenGarcia11.github.io/2damasi/media/posts/4/responsive/IMG_1510-lg.jpg 1024w ,https://RubenGarcia11.github.io/2damasi/media/posts/4/responsive/IMG_1510-xl.jpg 1360w ,https://RubenGarcia11.github.io/2damasi/media/posts/4/responsive/IMG_1510-2xl.jpg 1600w"></figure>Posteriormente seleccionamos la region</p>
<figure class="post__image"><img loading="lazy"  src="https://RubenGarcia11.github.io/2damasi/media/posts/4/IMG_1511.jpg" alt="" width="5712" height="4284" sizes="(max-width: 48em) 100vw, 768px" srcset="https://RubenGarcia11.github.io/2damasi/media/posts/4/responsive/IMG_1511-xs.jpg 300w ,https://RubenGarcia11.github.io/2damasi/media/posts/4/responsive/IMG_1511-sm.jpg 480w ,https://RubenGarcia11.github.io/2damasi/media/posts/4/responsive/IMG_1511-md.jpg 768w ,https://RubenGarcia11.github.io/2damasi/media/posts/4/responsive/IMG_1511-lg.jpg 1024w ,https://RubenGarcia11.github.io/2damasi/media/posts/4/responsive/IMG_1511-xl.jpg 1360w ,https://RubenGarcia11.github.io/2damasi/media/posts/4/responsive/IMG_1511-2xl.jpg 1600w"></figure>Seleccionamos como queremos ser tratados.</p>
